{# PDF source template for the Daily Recruiter Activity report.

Spec: routines/recruiter-activity.md § 8.1, § 8.3, § 8.4, § 8.5

Implementation reference for Phase 2 — what this template must produce:

  Cover top      → "Daily Recruiter Activity" title + report date
  Section 02     → header + 5 activity-number cards + 4-cell KPI strip + 1 callout
  Section 03     → header + recruiter table (sorted) + 0-2 callouts
  Footer         → "InnoSource Data Governance · Daily Recruiter Activity ·
                    Source: silver.v_applicant_activity_events ·
                    Confidential — InnoSource Internal Use · Page 1"

Base CSS comes from `reporting/styles/inno_source_report_style_guide.md` (loaded
via `framework.style.base_css()`). The template appends an "Activity Card
Extension" CSS block defining `.activity-cards`, `.activity-card`,
`.activity-number`, and `.activity-label` (large-number cards unique to § 02).

The 8 visual invariants in spec § 9 are enforced by
`tests/reports/test_recruiter_activity_render.py` — any template change that
violates one fails CI.

Template inputs: see spec § 8.3.
